@startuml api-bet-points
title GET /api/bet/points — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/points\nAuth (either):\n**Authorization: Bearer** login token\nor **X-User-Access-Token:** raw token\n(if both, **X-User-Access-Token** wins);

|AcceptBearerAccessToken|
:If **X-User-Access-Token** empty\nand **Authorization** is **Bearer** scheme,\ncopy Bearer token into **X-User-Access-Token**;

|BetPointsController|
:requireAuthenticatedUser() via **RequiresFoundationUser**;
|UserFoundationGateway|
:Memo / cache / GET **/api/user/me**;
|BetPointsController|
:Extract **uid** via **FoundationUser::id**;

|PointsAdminService|
:**PointsBalanceRepo** findByUid(uid);
if (row missing?) then (yes)
  :balance = 0;
else (exists)
  :balance = row.balance;
endif

|BetPointsController|
:**logHandledApiRequest** (handler: bet.points.show);
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**({ balance });

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
